{"id":"n32135-1-7","stage":5,"title":"결정짓다 · 决定","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32135-1-7-1","ko":"이렇게 큰일을 혼자 결정지으려고 하면 어떻게 해요?","zh":"您怎么能打算独自决定这么重要的事情呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰일을","meaning":"重，重大，严重；事情，工作","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；일：事情，工作；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"},{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결정지으려고","meaning":"决定，下决定","explanation":"결정짓다：决定，下决定；으려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"결정짓다","audio":"/audio/b55a62bae86fa13c9936.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32135","senseId":"1","lemma":"결정짓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"b55a62bae86fa13c","term":"결정짓다","zh":"决定，下决定","audio":"/audio/b55a62bae86fa13c9936.mp3","entryId":"32135","definition":"明确地定下来。","pronunciation":["결쩡짇따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）；决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9bee30022b0f53cbd5b0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32135-1-7-2","ko":"죄송해요. 다른 사람들의 의견도 들어 볼게요.","zh":"对不起，我会再听听其他人的意见的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들의","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의견도","meaning":"意见","explanation":"의견：意见；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"의견","audio":"/audio/1eaed37a207480d88b78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71118","senseId":"1","lemma":"의견","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"听，听从","explanation":"듣다：听，听从；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"3","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"1eaed37a207480d8","term":"의견","zh":"意见","audio":"/audio/1eaed37a207480d88b78.mp3","entryId":"71118","definition":"对某个对象或现象等有自己的判断和想法。","pronunciation":["의ː견"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听，听从","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"顺从别人所说的话。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8a362e792e6a58b9cd99.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.477,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=32135","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.3037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，我会再听听其他人的意见的。","我们当时应该去帮承奎的吧？","您怎么能打算独自决定这么重要的事情呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对不起，我会再听听其他人的意见的。","您怎么能打算独自决定这么重要的事情呢？","我们当时应该去帮承奎的吧？"],"answer":0}]}
